 10 years.","Net reinvestment is nil (capex and working capital no more than cover depreciation), so fundamental growth is near zero.","Forward indicators: deferred revenue up 71%.","Capex runs only 0.0x depreciation (0.4% of sales), so the asset base is being harvested rather than grown.","Its Rule of 40 score is 216, clearing the bar for a healthy growth business.","It has beaten earnings estimates by 4.0% on average."],"own":["Insiders own 18.3%, meaningful skin in the game, and institutions hold 72%.","Insiders have only sold over the past year (10 sales, net $2.4M sold).","It returns 3.7% a year to shareholders (4.1% in dividends).","The share count has grown 89.4% a year over five years, diluting existing holders."],"people":["With about 122 employees, each generates about $3.2M of revenue, 1.6x the Energy median, and productivity has risen 25.1% a year.","That works out to $1.7M of free cash flow per employee.","CEO pay is $1.9M (1x revenue per employee), and compensation governance scores well (1/10, lower is better).","Stock compensation averages $75K per employee."]},"profile":{"v":"WATCH","conv":93,"head":"Watch: LEAN BUY-rated, but the fair value is low-confidence (wide Monte Carlo spread).","pros":["Model rating LEAN BUY (composite 43, gates 13/25)","Trades 83% below fair value of $238","ROIC 24.3% vs WACC 9.8%","FCF margin 53.8%","Revenue grew 164.3%/yr over 5y"],"cons":["Fair value is low-confidence (wide Monte Carlo spread)"],"flags":[],"need":["the fair value is low-confidence (wide Monte Carlo spread)"],"buy_below":202.51,"vc":{"base":238.25,"base_src":"dcf","bear":109.74,"bull":508.25,"alt_median":79.25,"n_alt":2,"gap":3.3461,"dispersion":0.744,"level":"LOW","why":["Monte Carlo spread is wide","models disagree (74% dispersion)","DCF is 335% above the other models' median ($79.25)","bull case is 4.6x the bear case"]},"med":{"pe":13.3952,"ev_ebitda":6.86,"pfcf":14.299,"pb":1.6885,"roic":0.0952,"gross_margin":0.2462,"fcf_margin":0.0754,"div_yield":0.